The layer's unique object-id field is \strong{\code{OBJECTID_1}}, \emph{not} the plain
\code{OBJECTID} (which is non-unique on this layer and frequently \code{0}). All
attachment lookups and the internal id fallback key off \code{OBJECTID_1}.
